  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx : 2y = 4 : 9\n\n2 : x = 3 : 4\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n2/x = 3/4\n\n⇒ x = 8/3\n\nNow,\n\n⇒ x/2y = 4/9\n\n⇒ (8)/(3 times 2y) = (4)/(9)\n\n⇒ y = 3",
